WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.470
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.740 --> 01:47.970
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.080 --> 01:51.080
[Episode 1]

4
01:57.380 --> 01:58.780
[Domestic Security Check]

5
02:04.120 --> 02:05.210
Sorry, the subscriber

6
02:05.210 --> 02:06.370
you dialed

7
02:06.370 --> 02:08.370
cannot be connected for the moment.

8
02:09.710 --> 02:10.410
Miss. Miss.

9
02:10.710 --> 02:12.240
We're just one person short.

10
02:12.240 --> 02:12.740
We'll get there right on time.

11
02:12.740 --> 02:13.130
No, thanks.

12
02:13.130 --> 02:13.580
We'll be there in 20 minutes, I promise.

13
02:13.580 --> 02:14.410
No, thank you.

14
02:14.500 --> 02:14.910
Miss,

15
02:14.910 --> 02:15.690
you're from out of town, right?

16
02:15.690 --> 02:16.900
I see you've been standing there for ages.

17
02:16.900 --> 02:17.360
Don't have a place to stay?

18
02:17.360 --> 02:18.000
Come stay at our inn.

19
02:18.000 --> 02:18.590
No need, someone's picking me up.

20
02:18.590 --> 02:19.620
Our inn is just nearby.

21
02:19.620 --> 02:20.310
I'm not here for traveling.

22
02:20.310 --> 02:20.650
Miss.

23
02:20.650 --> 02:21.300
It's cheap and clean.

24
02:21.300 --> 02:22.060
We got all good reviews.

25
02:22.060 --> 02:23.460
I'll give you a discount!

26
02:25.800 --> 02:26.860
It's been an hour.

27
02:26.860 --> 02:28.790
Why isn't she answering the phone?

28
02:29.720 --> 02:30.370
Miss He.

29
02:30.400 --> 02:31.150
I've been at the airport

30
02:31.150 --> 02:32.150
for an hour now,

31
02:32.150 --> 02:33.590
but I haven't been able to reach you.

32
02:33.590 --> 02:34.810
I'm not sure what's going on.

33
02:34.810 --> 02:35.840
It's getting late.

34
02:35.840 --> 02:37.530
Please send someone to pick me up as soon as possible.

35
02:37.530 --> 02:38.150
Thank you.

36
02:39.000 --> 02:40.710
Does it sound a bit too harsh?

37
02:47.860 --> 02:49.470
Hello, Miss He.

38
02:49.579 --> 02:50.310
Sorry to bother you.

39
02:50.310 --> 02:51.410
May I ask...

40
02:53.240 --> 02:53.870
You...

41
02:56.030 --> 02:56.430
Hi.

42
02:56.810 --> 02:57.560
Excuse me.

43
02:57.560 --> 02:58.410
Are you here on vacation?

44
02:58.410 --> 02:58.800
No need.

45
02:58.800 --> 03:00.330
I'm not looking for a hotel.

46
03:00.560 --> 03:01.360
No, no. I just wanted

47
03:01.360 --> 03:03.120
to add you on WeChat.

48
03:04.120 --> 03:04.860
Don't worry,

49
03:04.860 --> 03:05.900
I'm not a bad person,

50
03:05.900 --> 03:08.090
and I'm not trying to lure you into staying at my hotel or anything.

51
03:08.090 --> 03:09.950
I just want to be friends with you.

52
03:11.400 --> 03:12.410
You're a student, right?

53
03:12.410 --> 03:13.470
I'm a student, too.

54
03:15.360 --> 03:16.360
Don't believe me?

55
03:16.460 --> 03:16.900
I can show you

56
03:16.900 --> 03:17.520
my student ID.

57
03:17.520 --> 03:18.620
No, no. No need.

58
03:18.620 --> 03:19.360
No need.

59
03:20.190 --> 03:21.000
Then,

60
03:21.880 --> 03:22.720
let me add you on WeChat first.

61
03:22.720 --> 03:23.520
I'll scan you.

62
03:23.810 --> 03:24.620
Come on.

63
03:28.650 --> 03:29.460
Accept it.

64
03:36.060 --> 03:38.590
Steal A Moment... To Sip Wine... Guesthouse?

65
03:39.880 --> 03:41.140
That's not important.

66
03:41.530 --> 03:42.130
Are you

67
03:42.130 --> 03:43.079
going to EAW?

68
03:44.710 --> 03:45.810
How do you know?

69
03:47.030 --> 03:47.620
Sorry.

70
03:47.620 --> 03:49.470
When I was adding you,

71
03:49.470 --> 03:50.530
I accidentally saw it.

72
03:50.530 --> 03:51.460
I didn't mean it.

73
03:53.340 --> 03:54.130
Well,

74
03:54.520 --> 03:56.280
aren't you here a bit too early?

75
03:57.190 --> 03:57.900
EAW

76
03:57.900 --> 03:59.680
won't open until the end of the month.

77
03:59.680 --> 04:00.910
I was invited here.

78
04:01.410 --> 04:02.130
Invited?

79
04:02.810 --> 04:03.150
So you're

80
04:03.150 --> 04:04.520
one of the invited content creators, right?

81
04:04.520 --> 04:05.030
Yes.

82
04:06.750 --> 04:08.680
Come with me. It's on my way anyway.

83
04:10.410 --> 04:11.470
Speaking of which,

84
04:11.860 --> 04:12.810
EAW

85
04:13.410 --> 04:15.470
actually has something to do with me.

86
04:15.810 --> 04:16.620
EAW—

87
04:17.180 --> 04:18.240
my brother owns it.

88
04:19.130 --> 04:20.540
What is he trying to do?

89
04:21.070 --> 04:23.220
Why doesn't he just brag that he owns it himself?

90
04:23.220 --> 04:24.480
It's too much trouble.

91
04:24.510 --> 04:25.560
I'll go...

92
04:25.560 --> 04:26.310
I'll go that way.

93
04:26.310 --> 04:27.180
I... I'm leaving now.

94
04:27.180 --> 04:27.860
Bye-bye.

95
04:28.560 --> 04:29.890
It's really no trouble.

96
04:35.370 --> 04:36.240
Sure, sure.

97
04:40.570 --> 04:41.630
Hello, Miss He.

98
04:41.630 --> 04:43.100
Ms. Idle Cloud, I'm so sorry.

99
04:43.100 --> 04:44.600
I accidentally fell asleep

100
04:44.600 --> 04:45.930
and didn't notice that the driver had canceled

101
04:45.930 --> 04:47.100
my airport pickup at the last minute.

102
04:47.100 --> 04:47.870
I-It's okay.

103
04:47.870 --> 04:50.540
I... I only just arrived not long ago.

104
04:50.890 --> 04:52.040
I've already contacted someone else

105
04:52.040 --> 04:52.950
to come pick you up.

106
04:52.950 --> 04:54.540
I've sent the license plate number to your phone.

107
04:54.540 --> 04:55.470
I-It's alright.

108
04:55.630 --> 04:56.630
See you tomorrow.

109
04:56.680 --> 04:57.630
See you tomorrow.

110
04:57.630 --> 04:58.570
Okay, bye-bye.

111
05:06.040 --> 05:08.170
That must've been the driver calling.

112
05:15.830 --> 05:16.770
Hello?

113
05:17.700 --> 05:18.570
Sorry.

114
05:18.570 --> 05:19.900
I accidentally hung up.

115
05:19.930 --> 05:20.680
Are you

116
05:20.680 --> 05:21.830
from EAW?

117
05:22.830 --> 05:24.360
Come out, cross the street,

118
05:25.270 --> 05:26.870
and you'll see a parking lot.

119
05:27.750 --> 05:28.630
I... Alright, I'll

120
05:28.630 --> 05:30.030
come out and find you now.

121
05:30.620 --> 05:31.680
Did you bring an umbrella?

122
05:31.680 --> 05:32.470
I did.

123
05:33.310 --> 05:35.280
I'll wait for you in the parking lot.

124
05:35.280 --> 05:35.820
Okay.

125
05:35.850 --> 05:36.980
I'll be right there.

126
06:14.510 --> 06:15.130
Hello.

127
06:15.130 --> 06:16.010
Are you the driver

128
06:16.010 --> 06:16.810
from EAW?

129
06:18.100 --> 06:19.940
Could you open the trunk, please?

130
06:19.940 --> 06:20.710
Thank you.

131
06:43.790 --> 06:45.390
It's okay. I can do it myself.

132
06:45.890 --> 06:47.120
Thank you.

133
06:55.130 --> 06:55.680
No need.

134
07:28.920 --> 07:30.580
There are tissues down there.

135
07:31.860 --> 07:32.650
Thank you.

136
07:40.740 --> 07:42.270
S-Sorry

137
07:42.360 --> 07:43.060
for troubling you

138
07:43.060 --> 07:44.920
to come pick me up so late at night.

139
07:47.950 --> 07:48.600
Where to?

140
07:50.690 --> 07:51.860
Yangjin Hotel.

141
07:51.950 --> 07:52.750
Thank you.

142
08:14.800 --> 08:16.720
About how long will it take?

143
08:17.130 --> 08:17.960
30 minutes.

144
08:20.060 --> 08:20.860
Okay.

145
08:30.000 --> 08:32.460
Why are we taking such a remote route?

146
08:43.679 --> 08:45.910
I've already transferred the money to you.

147
08:45.910 --> 08:46.770
Cut the crap.

148
08:47.150 --> 08:47.960
Money?

149
08:48.080 --> 08:48.870
What money?

150
08:49.340 --> 08:51.750
I hope he hasn't sold me already.

151
09:05.720 --> 09:06.980
Why is he looking at me?

152
09:07.550 --> 09:08.390
Help.

153
09:08.390 --> 09:09.940
Where is this?

154
09:14.980 --> 09:16.580
The highway is under repair.

155
09:16.860 --> 09:18.060
This route is faster.

156
09:19.890 --> 09:21.150
I... I'm not in a hurry.

157
09:21.500 --> 09:22.290
Not at all.

158
09:51.360 --> 09:52.150
Thank you.

159
09:52.720 --> 09:53.860
I can do it myself.

160
10:04.320 --> 10:05.250
W-Wait a minute.

161
10:09.960 --> 10:12.180
The rain probably won't stop any time soon.

162
10:12.180 --> 10:13.170
I'll be stopping by

163
10:13.170 --> 10:14.060
EAW tomorrow.

164
10:14.130 --> 10:16.260
You can just leave it at the front desk.

165
11:07.400 --> 11:10.210
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

166
11:11.080 --> 11:13.730
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

167
11:14.420 --> 11:16.830
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

168
11:16.850 --> 11:20.050
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

169
11:20.960 --> 11:24.050
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

170
11:24.540 --> 11:26.700
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

171
11:26.970 --> 11:30.010
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

172
11:27.860 --> 11:30.120
We've arrived at Xifu Experimental Middle School.

173
11:30.120 --> 11:31.290
Passengers getting off,

174
11:30.710 --> 11:34.010
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

175
11:31.290 --> 11:33.220
please exit through the rear door.

176
11:35.580 --> 11:38.510
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

177
11:38.530 --> 11:40.690
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

178
11:42.560 --> 11:45.510
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

179
11:45.540 --> 11:47.830
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

180
11:49.070 --> 11:52.470
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

181
11:52.650 --> 11:55.510
♪ To meet the moon ♪

182
11:55.530 --> 11:58.460
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

183
11:58.490 --> 12:01.380
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

184
12:01.400 --> 12:05.560
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

185
12:05.890 --> 12:08.760
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

186
12:08.870 --> 12:12.610
♪ Love gives us all ♪

187
12:12.630 --> 12:15.690
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

188
12:15.710 --> 12:16.530
♪ You know ♪

189
12:16.550 --> 12:19.790
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

190
12:19.810 --> 12:22.610
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

191
12:22.640 --> 12:26.220
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

192
12:27.120 --> 12:32.020
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

193
13:08.200 --> 13:08.990
Dear.

194
13:09.550 --> 13:12.080
Why are you picking a fight with our daughter?

195
13:12.170 --> 13:14.170
How is this picking a fight with her?

196
13:15.120 --> 13:16.720
I'm just looking out for her.

197
13:16.740 --> 13:17.530
Yun Ye.

198
13:21.410 --> 13:22.810
Did she pick up the phone?

199
13:23.410 --> 13:24.050
No.

200
13:24.480 --> 13:25.240
Keep calling

201
13:25.240 --> 13:26.220
until she does.

202
13:29.010 --> 13:29.940
Do it right here!

203
13:30.670 --> 13:31.530
I'll watch you!

204
13:43.630 --> 13:44.480
She hung up.

205
14:00.960 --> 14:02.100
I already made it clear.

206
14:02.100 --> 14:03.580
Why are you calling me again?

207
14:03.580 --> 14:04.370
Hello, Li? Li,

208
14:04.370 --> 14:05.320
hurry and tell Dad.

209
14:05.320 --> 14:05.870
T-Tell him

210
14:05.870 --> 14:06.960
that we weren't in on this together.

211
14:06.960 --> 14:08.420
Hurry up a-and tell him...

212
14:10.720 --> 14:11.620
Where are you?

213
14:11.750 --> 14:13.370
You think you're all grown up now, huh?

214
14:13.370 --> 14:15.170
I just scolded you a little, and now you're not coming home?

215
14:15.170 --> 14:16.230
I'm in Nanwu.

216
14:16.270 --> 14:17.800
What are you doing in Nanwu?

217
14:18.670 --> 14:20.410
I'm attending an event

218
14:21.290 --> 14:22.840
and getting to know the campus while I'm there.

219
14:22.840 --> 14:24.320
I won't be coming back for now.

220
14:24.320 --> 14:25.120
And I'm going to look for

221
14:25.120 --> 14:26.820
an internship here afterward.

222
14:26.820 --> 14:27.680
No, you're not!

223
14:27.870 --> 14:29.660
Why did you have to go so far away?

224
14:29.660 --> 14:30.170
Come back

225
14:30.170 --> 14:31.240
and just stay at home.

226
14:31.240 --> 14:32.030
Either find yourself a job

227
14:32.030 --> 14:32.910
in Xifu

228
14:33.010 --> 14:33.980
or reapply for

229
14:33.980 --> 14:35.710
a local graduate program here.

230
14:37.670 --> 14:39.770
D-Don't be so bossy.

231
14:39.790 --> 14:42.120
At least listen to what Li has to say first.

232
14:42.580 --> 14:44.110
Dad, you don't understand.

233
14:44.170 --> 14:45.740
NUST is a great university.

234
14:45.740 --> 14:46.170
Its automation program

235
14:46.170 --> 14:47.770
is one of the best in the country.

236
14:47.770 --> 14:48.670
Stop talking about that.

237
14:48.670 --> 14:50.320
Book a flight and come back right away.

238
14:50.320 --> 14:51.120
I won't!

239
14:54.080 --> 14:54.870
Lili,

240
14:55.700 --> 14:57.600
your dad is only saying this because he cares about you.

241
14:57.600 --> 14:58.550
This is the first time

242
14:58.550 --> 15:01.120
you've gone somewhere so far away by yourself.

243
15:01.120 --> 15:02.780
We're just worried about you.

244
15:03.010 --> 15:04.860
If you have any plans

245
15:04.860 --> 15:06.150
for your studies or career,

246
15:06.150 --> 15:08.080
just talk them through with Dad.

247
15:08.910 --> 15:10.640
There's nothing to talk about.

248
15:10.670 --> 15:11.860
Either come back now,

249
15:11.860 --> 15:13.250
or don't ever come back.

250
15:13.450 --> 15:15.840
Don't even think about taking a single penny from us.

251
15:15.840 --> 15:17.480
Wait. I'm just doing my internship

252
15:17.480 --> 15:18.620
and looking for a job in another city.

253
15:18.620 --> 15:20.260
What's the problem with that?

254
15:20.260 --> 15:20.860
It's not like

255
15:20.860 --> 15:22.550
I'm never coming back.

256
15:22.860 --> 15:24.860
Every time I try to have a proper conversation with you,

257
15:24.860 --> 15:26.960
when have you ever actually listened?

258
15:26.960 --> 15:28.270
I can't even finish a sentence

259
15:28.270 --> 15:29.120
before you shut me down.

260
15:29.120 --> 15:29.980
Other than disagreeing with me,

261
15:29.980 --> 15:31.380
what else do you ever say?

262
15:31.550 --> 15:32.360
Lili.

263
15:33.480 --> 15:34.250
Lili.

264
15:34.250 --> 15:35.850
Don't take it out on your dad.

265
15:36.250 --> 15:38.410
You know what he's like.

266
15:39.250 --> 15:42.050
He's harsh on the outside but soft on the inside.

267
15:43.120 --> 15:44.980
Talk some sense into your sister.

268
15:45.410 --> 15:46.250
Li. Li,

269
15:46.270 --> 15:47.660
s-stop making things worse.

270
15:47.660 --> 15:48.370
Just come home,

271
15:48.370 --> 15:49.050
apologize to Dad,

272
15:49.050 --> 15:49.580
and back down a bit—

273
15:49.580 --> 15:51.240
then everything will be fine.

274
16:04.750 --> 16:07.080
Where would you get all that money, Yun Li?

275
16:14.530 --> 16:16.290
Why did I have to act so tough?

276
17:00.390 --> 17:01.200
Shize.

277
17:02.480 --> 17:04.540
Why did I have to cross paths with you?

278
17:10.880 --> 17:11.680
Yuan...

279
18:03.900 --> 18:05.830
The money has been transferred to you.

280
18:05.830 --> 18:06.610
Cut the crap.

281
18:58.500 --> 18:59.170
Hello?

282
18:59.190 --> 19:00.080
Ms. Idle Cloud.

283
19:00.110 --> 19:01.180
We'll all gather

284
19:01.180 --> 19:01.850
in the lobby of the Experience Center

285
19:01.850 --> 19:03.310
at 3 p.m. this afternoon.

286
19:03.350 --> 19:04.250
The company has arranged

287
19:04.250 --> 19:06.110
a visit and hands-on experience session for everyone.

288
19:06.110 --> 19:07.750
Please be sure to attend on time.

289
19:07.750 --> 19:08.720
Okay, I will.

290
19:11.660 --> 19:13.160
3 p.m.

291
19:26.900 --> 19:28.250
What you are seeing now

292
19:28.250 --> 19:28.880
is our...

293
19:29.290 --> 19:31.180
I'll watch whatever video Mr. Feishui makes.

294
19:31.180 --> 19:32.180
This is the first floor

295
19:32.180 --> 19:33.780
of our VR experience center.

296
19:35.960 --> 19:36.770
You are...

297
19:37.410 --> 19:39.330
I'm Idle Cloud Tick-Tock.

298
19:39.920 --> 19:41.220
Oh, Ms. Idle Cloud!

299
19:41.980 --> 19:42.960
We chatted through private messages

300
19:42.960 --> 19:44.160
on EAW before.

301
19:44.160 --> 19:45.220
I'm Fairy Feifei,

302
19:45.220 --> 19:46.680
a dance-section content creator.

303
19:46.680 --> 19:47.460
Oh yeah, we did.

304
19:47.460 --> 19:48.460
Let me introduce.

305
19:48.850 --> 19:49.660
Mr. Feishui.

306
19:50.350 --> 19:51.980
He's one of the top 10

307
19:51.980 --> 19:52.980
most influential content creators on EAW.

308
19:52.980 --> 19:53.920
Hello.

309
19:53.920 --> 19:54.240
Hello.

310
19:54.240 --> 19:56.090
And there's Ms. Can't-Know-It-All.

311
19:56.090 --> 19:56.700
Hello.

312
19:57.770 --> 19:58.980
Hello, Ms. Idle Cloud.

313
19:58.980 --> 20:00.810
We just got the phone set up

314
20:00.810 --> 20:01.960
and are about to do a test recording.

315
20:01.960 --> 20:02.750
Awesome.

316
20:02.850 --> 20:03.710
See you in a bit.

317
20:05.050 --> 20:06.660
Are you a bit shy around people?

318
20:06.660 --> 20:07.480
It's okay.

319
20:07.510 --> 20:08.660
Everyone here's really nice.

320
20:08.660 --> 20:09.590
Don't be afraid.

321
20:11.610 --> 20:12.350
Mr. K.

322
20:12.350 --> 20:13.070
Isn't this the latest

323
20:13.070 --> 20:13.960
drone model?

324
20:13.980 --> 20:15.510
You got your hands on it so fast.

325
20:15.510 --> 20:16.000
As

326
20:16.000 --> 20:16.980
professional content creators,

327
20:16.980 --> 20:18.610
we must deliver

328
20:18.610 --> 20:19.310
the best visual effects

329
20:19.310 --> 20:20.460
to our fans.

330
20:20.460 --> 20:21.380
The best.

331
20:22.110 --> 20:22.920
Mr. K.

332
20:23.920 --> 20:25.980
This drone is so cool.

333
20:26.180 --> 20:27.380
It must be expensive.

334
20:27.770 --> 20:28.750
It's the Magic 3.

335
20:29.050 --> 20:30.050
Not only is it expensive,

336
20:30.050 --> 20:31.510
it's also very hard to get.

337
20:31.960 --> 20:33.310
My friend's company developed it.

338
20:33.310 --> 20:34.250
If you guys want one,

339
20:34.250 --> 20:35.650
just let me know anytime.

340
20:35.960 --> 20:37.010
But it's so high-end.

341
20:37.010 --> 20:38.350
Is it hard to fly?

342
20:38.350 --> 20:39.160
It's easy.

343
20:39.550 --> 20:41.050
A quadcopter like this

344
20:41.220 --> 20:42.310
is basically like a remote-control car.

345
20:42.310 --> 20:43.220
Anyone can fly it.

346
20:43.220 --> 20:44.750
This is an octocopter.

347
20:47.610 --> 20:49.250
Although it only has 4 arms,

348
20:49.250 --> 20:50.070
each arm has

349
20:50.090 --> 20:51.750
2 motors and 2 propellers, one on top and one on the bottom,

350
20:51.750 --> 20:53.410
which makes it an octocopter.

351
20:55.460 --> 20:57.420
Its special carbon fiber alloy propellers

352
20:57.420 --> 20:58.050
allow it

353
20:58.050 --> 21:00.010
to operate normally across a wide temperature range.

354
21:00.010 --> 21:01.070
It features a 100-megapixel

355
21:01.070 --> 21:02.460
Hasselblad main camera,

356
21:02.460 --> 21:04.720
omnidirectional intelligent tracking

357
21:04.810 --> 21:05.810
and vision sensing,

358
21:05.810 --> 21:07.570
low-light active obstacle avoidance,

359
21:07.570 --> 21:08.750
and a 360-degree rotating gimbal.

360
21:08.750 --> 21:10.150
It's really impressive.

361
21:12.350 --> 21:14.660
Ah... I know this.

362
21:14.660 --> 21:15.010
I...

363
21:15.010 --> 21:16.210
Of course I know this.

364
21:17.010 --> 21:18.740
It was just a slip of the tongue.

365
21:20.160 --> 21:21.160
Wait, who are you?

366
21:22.380 --> 21:22.920
I'm

367
21:22.920 --> 21:24.660
a tech-section content creator,

368
21:24.660 --> 21:25.920
Idle Cloud Tick-Tock.

369
21:26.750 --> 21:27.920
Idle Cloud what?

370
21:28.750 --> 21:30.150
Idle Cloud Tick-Tock...

371
21:30.160 --> 21:31.160
Hello, everyone.

372
21:32.180 --> 21:33.180
Welcome to

373
21:33.180 --> 21:34.550
the EAW Experience Hall.

374
21:34.550 --> 21:35.680
I'm your guide,

375
21:35.680 --> 21:36.480
He Jiameng.

376
21:36.770 --> 21:37.900
EAW

377
21:37.900 --> 21:39.180
is the first

378
21:39.180 --> 21:40.850
virtual reality experience hall in Nanwu.

379
21:40.850 --> 21:41.570
Its full name is

380
21:41.570 --> 21:42.330
Enjoy Another

381
21:42.330 --> 21:43.010
World.

382
21:43.420 --> 21:44.510
This is also our company's

383
21:44.510 --> 21:45.550
core philosophy.

384
21:45.550 --> 21:47.050
At the moment, our main projects

385
21:47.050 --> 21:49.220
include VR device development,

386
21:49.380 --> 21:50.700
VR gaming experiences,

387
21:50.700 --> 21:51.200
smart

388
21:51.200 --> 21:53.160
living scenario simulations, and more.

389
21:53.160 --> 21:54.050
The exhibition hall

390
21:54.050 --> 21:55.110
we're in now

391
21:55.160 --> 21:57.360
is our Smart Living Experience Center.

392
21:57.980 --> 21:59.010
Feel free

393
21:59.010 --> 22:00.160
to explore on your own,

394
22:00.160 --> 22:00.960
and if you need anything

395
22:00.960 --> 22:02.360
just let me know anytime.

396
22:02.660 --> 22:04.380
We have many types here.

397
22:04.380 --> 22:05.400
If you are interested,

398
22:05.400 --> 22:07.200
you can experience it yourself.

399
22:08.460 --> 22:09.460
Hello, Tangy.

400
22:10.050 --> 22:10.780
I'm right...

401
22:12.200 --> 22:13.660
Everyone, take a look here as well.

402
22:13.660 --> 22:15.590
The equipment is really advanced.

403
22:18.010 --> 22:19.070
You mean the face?

404
22:20.550 --> 22:22.350
The entire body from head to toe.

405
22:22.420 --> 22:23.220
Miss He.

406
22:24.110 --> 22:24.660
Um,

407
22:24.660 --> 22:26.090
is there a place to charge here?

408
22:26.090 --> 22:27.440
My phone is dead.

409
22:27.940 --> 22:29.670
You can charge it in the lounge.

410
22:30.030 --> 22:30.530
Okay.

411
22:30.530 --> 22:31.550
Do you want me to take you there?

412
22:31.550 --> 22:33.370
No need, I can go by myself. Thanks.

413
22:33.370 --> 22:34.480
This is the project.

414
22:34.480 --> 22:36.340
You can go over and experience it.

415
22:55.660 --> 22:56.460
Hello, Tangy.

416
22:57.050 --> 22:58.180
What's going on with you?

417
22:58.180 --> 23:00.050
Why couldn't I get through to your phone?

418
23:00.050 --> 23:01.310
My phone died.

419
23:01.310 --> 23:02.960
I just plugged it in to charge.

420
23:02.960 --> 23:04.380
I was so worried.

421
23:04.460 --> 23:06.520
I thought something happened to you.

422
23:07.220 --> 23:08.310
Where are you now?

423
23:08.880 --> 23:09.830
I'm visiting

424
23:09.830 --> 23:10.750
EAW right now.

425
23:10.980 --> 23:11.980
EAW?

426
23:13.270 --> 23:14.610
A relative of my college roommate

427
23:14.610 --> 23:15.720
works at EAW.

428
23:15.720 --> 23:17.070
Do you want me to introduce you

429
23:17.070 --> 23:18.600
so they can look out for you?

430
23:18.610 --> 23:19.420
N-No need.

431
23:19.570 --> 23:20.810
Don't go to the trouble.

432
23:20.810 --> 23:21.750
It's no trouble.

433
23:22.050 --> 23:22.810
Her name is Xia.

434
23:22.810 --> 23:23.870
She's really nice.

435
23:24.160 --> 23:25.960
T-There's really no need for that, Tangy.

436
23:25.960 --> 23:26.680
I bet you're just

437
23:26.680 --> 23:28.610
scared of talking to older people.

438
23:29.960 --> 23:31.750
You really know me.

439
23:31.980 --> 23:33.420
With the way you are,

440
23:33.420 --> 23:36.020
how can you manage to live on your own out there?

441
23:36.250 --> 23:37.350
You didn't secretly cry

442
23:37.350 --> 23:39.150
at the hotel last night, did you?

443
23:39.480 --> 23:40.980
I didn't cry,

444
23:40.980 --> 23:42.770
but I was scared out of my wits.

445
23:43.960 --> 23:44.980
What happened?

446
23:45.380 --> 23:46.510
Let me tell you. The driver

447
23:46.510 --> 23:47.570
who picked me up last night

448
23:47.570 --> 23:48.550
was terrifying.

449
23:48.550 --> 23:49.610
He had this cold expression the whole ride

450
23:49.610 --> 23:51.070
and didn't say a single word.

451
23:51.070 --> 23:52.420
And the roads were pitch black.

452
23:52.420 --> 23:53.570
I was so nervous

453
23:53.570 --> 23:55.430
I even had nightmares afterward.

454
23:55.610 --> 23:56.940
What kind of nightmare?

455
23:57.900 --> 24:00.680
I dreamed he stabbed me to death

456
24:00.680 --> 24:02.180
with my umbrella.

457
24:03.030 --> 24:05.030
How could an umbrella kill someone?

458
24:05.200 --> 24:07.590
Maybe it was just because of the atmosphere last night.

459
24:07.590 --> 24:08.640
It was raining,

460
24:08.640 --> 24:10.070
and the whole situation felt like something out of a suspense movie.

461
24:10.070 --> 24:11.570
And I lent him my umbrella.

462
24:11.700 --> 24:13.380
That dream's way too ominous.

463
24:13.530 --> 24:14.480
The umbrella you lent him

464
24:14.480 --> 24:16.080
turned into a deadly weapon.

465
24:16.290 --> 24:17.900
You'd better get the umbrella back as soon as possible.

466
24:17.900 --> 24:19.380
I wouldn't feel comfortable knowing the "murder weapon"

467
24:19.380 --> 24:21.030
is still with the "murderer."

468
24:21.030 --> 24:22.740
L-Listen to me carefully.

469
24:23.270 --> 24:24.380
I have a feeling

470
24:24.790 --> 24:26.650
that he looks somewhat familiar.

471
24:34.590 --> 24:35.400
Tangy.

472
24:35.420 --> 24:36.500
I feel like there's someone

473
24:36.500 --> 24:37.480
in my room.

474
24:37.820 --> 24:39.360
H-Hold on a second.

475
25:01.110 --> 25:01.920
I'm sorry.

476
25:01.920 --> 25:04.520
I-I didn't know there was someone in this room.

477
26:00.490 --> 26:01.350
Your umbrella.

478
26:16.050 --> 26:16.850
Thanks.

479
26:18.540 --> 26:19.470
You're welcome.

480
26:33.570 --> 26:34.630
A folding umbrella

481
26:35.520 --> 26:37.120
can't possibly kill anyone.

482
26:40.450 --> 26:42.180
A straight-handled one might.

483
26:44.820 --> 26:47.080
Then what kind of umbrella could kill...

484
26:49.210 --> 26:51.210
I mean, what kind of umbrella

485
26:51.230 --> 26:52.490
should I avoid buying?

486
26:52.940 --> 26:54.740
You don't have enough strength.

487
26:55.240 --> 26:57.040
It wouldn't matter what you buy.

488
26:59.720 --> 27:00.880
I see. I...

489
27:01.620 --> 27:02.880
Thanks for the advice.

490
27:23.350 --> 27:25.810
Ms. Idle Cloud, wanna take a photo together?

491
27:26.480 --> 27:28.250
How many followers does she have

492
27:28.250 --> 27:29.670
to be acting so full of herself?

493
27:29.670 --> 27:31.520
M-Maybe it's just too noisy

494
27:31.550 --> 27:32.810
and she didn't hear us.

495
27:34.380 --> 27:35.250
Ms. Idle Cloud.

496
27:35.850 --> 27:37.050
Are you free tonight?

497
27:37.880 --> 27:38.720
What's up?

498
27:38.820 --> 27:39.760
You weren't here just now.

499
27:39.760 --> 27:41.050
I've notified everyone else

500
27:41.050 --> 27:42.680
that Mr. Xu wanted to invite

501
27:42.680 --> 27:44.850
all the content creators for a get-together tonight.

502
27:44.850 --> 27:46.660
So we're having dinner together?

503
27:46.660 --> 27:47.850
It's not mandatory.

504
27:48.050 --> 27:49.980
If you don't want to go,

505
27:50.090 --> 27:51.740
I'll tell him you have other plans.

506
27:51.740 --> 27:53.720
Okay. Thank you, Miss He.

507
27:54.750 --> 27:56.110
How was your tour just now?

508
27:56.110 --> 27:57.210
Is everyone here?

509
27:57.530 --> 27:58.330
Yes.

510
27:59.350 --> 28:00.610
This is Ms. Idle Cloud.

511
28:00.640 --> 28:02.110
This is our boss, Mr. Xu.

512
28:02.270 --> 28:03.070
Hello.

513
28:03.510 --> 28:04.310
Hello.

514
28:05.010 --> 28:05.980
I'm Xu Qingsong.

515
28:06.500 --> 28:07.550
Hello, Mr. Xu.

516
28:08.740 --> 28:10.010
Thank you all for taking the time out of your busy schedules

517
28:10.010 --> 28:10.980
to participate.

518
28:11.290 --> 28:12.180
I'm the owner of EAW,

519
28:12.180 --> 28:13.330
Xu Qingsong.

520
28:13.850 --> 28:15.300
Please forgive us

521
28:15.380 --> 28:17.220
if our hospitality falls short.

522
28:17.980 --> 28:18.920
We'd appreciate your help

523
28:18.920 --> 28:19.810
in making

524
28:19.920 --> 28:21.720
EAW's promotional videos then.

525
28:22.090 --> 28:23.530
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

526
28:23.810 --> 28:25.410
Thank you for your hard work.

527
28:27.140 --> 28:27.880
Mr. Xu.

528
28:29.090 --> 28:29.900
I didn't expect

529
28:29.900 --> 28:31.630
you to be so young and handsome.

530
28:32.490 --> 28:33.290
You are?

531
28:33.380 --> 28:34.640
Just call me Feifei.

532
28:35.420 --> 28:36.570
Hello, Ms. Feifei.

533
28:36.930 --> 28:39.220
Thank you for coming to help with the promotion.

534
28:39.220 --> 28:41.160
No need to address me with "Ms."

535
28:41.570 --> 28:42.830
It makes me sound old.

536
28:43.410 --> 28:45.040
Can I just call you Qingsong?

537
28:47.350 --> 28:48.570
Let's add each other on WeChat, shall we?

538
28:48.570 --> 28:49.880
That way, after I finish editing the video,

539
28:49.880 --> 28:51.010
I can send it to you,

540
28:51.050 --> 28:52.910
and you can give me some guidance.

541
28:52.980 --> 28:54.510
I won't call it "guidance."

542
28:54.880 --> 28:56.460
Just do it as you normally would.

543
28:56.460 --> 28:57.180
And when the video is ready,

544
28:57.180 --> 28:59.040
just send it directly to Jiameng.

545
28:59.480 --> 29:00.290
Thank you.

546
29:04.850 --> 29:06.720
Are all bosses this cool?

547
29:11.660 --> 29:13.480
Welcome to

548
29:13.550 --> 29:14.380
Wings of the

549
29:14.400 --> 29:14.870
Sky.

550
29:14.960 --> 29:17.030
Here, you'll become a pilot,

551
29:17.070 --> 29:18.420
and we'll take you on

552
29:18.420 --> 29:20.330
an immersive flying experience.

553
29:20.430 --> 29:21.240
Young lady,

554
29:21.880 --> 29:23.010
you want to try this?

555
29:23.530 --> 29:24.330
Yes.

556
29:24.650 --> 29:25.500
Good taste.

557
29:25.530 --> 29:26.770
Do you want me to take you there?

558
29:26.770 --> 29:27.090
No need.

559
29:27.090 --> 29:28.400
I can go by myself.

560
29:29.640 --> 29:30.940
[Xia]

561
29:34.180 --> 29:35.290
That old man

562
29:35.440 --> 29:37.440
must be Xia's relative.

563
29:45.000 --> 29:45.860
Ms. Idle Cloud.

564
29:47.850 --> 29:48.790
Mr. Xu.

565
29:50.070 --> 29:51.070
You want to try this?

566
29:51.070 --> 29:51.880
Yes.

567
29:52.830 --> 29:53.830
Great taste.

568
29:53.830 --> 29:54.500
This game features

569
29:54.500 --> 29:56.640
cutting-edge spatial awareness technology,

570
29:56.640 --> 29:58.100
but it can be a bit intense.

571
29:58.350 --> 29:59.480
Do you want to try it?

572
30:00.590 --> 30:01.440
And I'll highlight this

573
30:01.440 --> 30:02.830
in my video.

574
30:03.280 --> 30:04.340
That's great.

575
30:04.570 --> 30:05.270
Wait a moment,

576
30:05.270 --> 30:06.250
I'll get someone here for you.

577
30:06.250 --> 30:06.740
Okay.

578
30:07.770 --> 30:09.570
Let me show you around the front.

579
30:11.730 --> 30:12.790
Help out with this.

580
30:18.110 --> 30:20.020
We're short-handed.

581
30:20.520 --> 30:21.320
Thanks.

582
30:22.790 --> 30:24.590
Don't keep her waiting too long.

583
30:26.640 --> 30:27.900
He'll help you with it.

584
30:28.710 --> 30:30.270
Why is it him again?

585
30:48.630 --> 30:50.360
Put your feet into these rings.

586
31:05.880 --> 31:06.810
Is it too tight?

587
31:08.550 --> 31:09.240
No.

588
31:09.830 --> 31:10.640
Impressive.

589
31:10.770 --> 31:11.610
You handle it with ease

590
31:11.610 --> 31:12.940
on your first try.

591
31:15.350 --> 31:16.210
Ms. Idle Cloud,

592
31:16.930 --> 31:18.190
enjoy the experience.

593
31:23.380 --> 31:26.040
Have you never tied this for anyone else before?

594
31:28.460 --> 31:28.960
No.

595
31:30.090 --> 31:32.460
Then have you attended any training?

596
31:32.810 --> 31:33.670
What training?

597
31:34.810 --> 31:38.000
Like how to tie this safety rope

598
31:38.000 --> 31:38.850
most securely

599
31:38.850 --> 31:40.610
and minimize

600
31:40.610 --> 31:41.700
the risk factor.

601
31:42.180 --> 31:42.640
No.

602
31:46.460 --> 31:47.050
Then,

603
31:47.200 --> 31:48.700
if it's not fastened properly,

604
31:48.700 --> 31:50.110
could I get thrown out?

605
31:53.700 --> 31:54.500
No idea.

606
32:08.500 --> 32:10.700
Don't worry, I've checked everything.

607
32:16.740 --> 32:18.030
The game has started.

608
32:18.180 --> 32:19.570
Please get ready.

609
32:36.920 --> 32:38.740
♪ Sitting by the window ♪

610
32:38.760 --> 32:41.110
♪ Watching the afternoon breeze ♪

611
32:41.130 --> 32:43.370
♪ Clouds like cotton candy ♪

612
32:43.400 --> 32:45.360
♪ Lining up in secret ♪

613
32:45.470 --> 32:47.600
♪ I turn my headphones up ♪

614
32:47.630 --> 32:49.610
♪ As loud as they can go ♪

615
32:49.630 --> 32:51.610
♪ Listening to my own heartbeat ♪

616
32:51.770 --> 32:53.610
♪ Something feels a little strange ♪

617
32:55.970 --> 32:58.030
♪ What's happening to me? ♪

618
32:58.050 --> 33:00.120
♪ I can't find the remote ♪

619
33:00.150 --> 33:02.380
♪ What's happening to me now? ♪

620
33:02.410 --> 33:04.430
♪ My heart suddenly skips a beat ♪

621
33:04.450 --> 33:06.020
♪ A little anxious ♪

622
33:06.050 --> 33:07.520
♪ A little curious ♪

623
33:07.540 --> 33:09.660
♪ My whole world is you ♪

624
33:09.690 --> 33:10.580
♪ Oh my, oh my ♪

625
33:10.610 --> 33:12.280
♪ This little craziness ♪

626
33:12.300 --> 33:14.880
♪ Feels a little sweet ♪

627
33:25.640 --> 33:26.880
So cute.

628
33:57.910 --> 33:59.560
The game is about to end.

629
34:14.389 --> 34:15.620
S-Sorry.

630
34:15.940 --> 34:17.480
T-The experience was too real.

631
34:17.480 --> 34:19.510
I felt weightless all of a sudden.

632
34:24.050 --> 34:25.130
I want to ask,

633
34:26.100 --> 34:27.409
is this game

634
34:27.429 --> 34:28.929
supposed to have no sound?

635
34:30.340 --> 34:31.400
I-I just noticed

636
34:31.400 --> 34:32.360
the NPC was speaking,

637
34:32.360 --> 34:33.889
but I didn't hear any sound.

638
34:39.360 --> 34:40.900
The game's over.

639
34:41.030 --> 34:43.360
Welcome to experience it again next time.

640
34:48.300 --> 34:49.090
It has sound,

641
34:49.730 --> 34:52.440
but the right ear channel seems to be broken.

642
34:56.170 --> 34:56.900
Did you

643
34:57.550 --> 34:59.150
hear nothing at all just now?

644
35:00.170 --> 35:00.670
Yeah.

645
35:01.440 --> 35:03.050
Maybe I was just too nervous

646
35:03.300 --> 35:04.360
and didn't hear it.

647
35:10.780 --> 35:12.230
I hope he didn't realize

648
35:12.420 --> 35:14.300
that my left ear is deaf.

649
35:18.820 --> 35:20.050
Impressive, Mr. K.

650
35:23.940 --> 35:24.670
Mr. K,

651
35:24.940 --> 35:26.170
you're so amazing.

652
35:27.610 --> 35:28.570
This is nothing.

653
35:28.730 --> 35:30.730
I'll do an even better trick for you.

654
35:37.610 --> 35:39.030
C-Crap.

655
35:41.150 --> 35:41.810
Crap. Crap.

656
35:43.400 --> 35:44.730
I-I-I borrowed this.

657
35:44.730 --> 35:46.050
What should I do?

658
35:50.210 --> 35:51.110
Need help?

659
36:03.710 --> 36:04.360
Let me try.

660
36:36.580 --> 36:38.440
How many times did he make it spin?

661
36:45.960 --> 36:47.620
It can actually fly like this?

662
37:01.690 --> 37:03.510
♪ It's as if I hear a voice ♪

663
37:03.530 --> 37:06.540
♪ Telling me to bravely follow my heart ♪

664
37:08.400 --> 37:10.860
♪ Until you came along ♪

665
37:10.880 --> 37:14.510
♪ And made my heart skip a beat ♪

666
37:14.730 --> 37:15.780
Cube Roll!

667
37:16.320 --> 37:16.920
Unique's

668
37:16.490 --> 37:18.800
♪ Not much has to be said ♪

669
37:16.920 --> 37:17.980
youngest member,

670
37:17.980 --> 37:18.760
Fu Shize,

671
37:18.820 --> 37:22.150
♪ One look is all it takes ♪

672
37:18.920 --> 37:20.940
is now executing the Cube Roll!

673
37:23.880 --> 37:25.880
♪ That distant silhouette ♪

674
37:25.900 --> 37:30.160
♪ Became crystal clear in this moment ♪

675
37:31.570 --> 37:35.050
♪ I know those fears ♪

676
37:35.070 --> 37:37.990
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

